# No IDE / AI tool promotion

Never add attribution, advertising, or branding for any IDE or AI product.

## Forbidden

- Git trailers: `Co-authored-by: Cursor`, `Made-with: Cursor`, Copilot, Windsurf, Codeium, etc.
- PR bodies, release notes, README, comments, or footers that credit tools
- Commit messages that promote or name the IDE/agent used

## Required

- Commits and PRs list only the human author unless the user explicitly names another person
- Neutral change descriptions without tool marketing

## Scope

Applies to Cursor, VS Code, GitHub Copilot, Windsurf, Trae, JetBrains AI, and any similar product.
